  "limits": [
    "The unchanged pinned Chocolate Doom DEH_GetChar/DEH_ReadLine/CleanString/DEH_ParseAssignment functions supply the independent text oracle. Original source notices remain in the downloaded cache; the repository records exact source hashes.",
